# c78l L3d: L3a with the LEFT STACK L1/L2 and TP LEVEL-HELD (extended at closed rest, heads at (-1,1) (-1,2) (0,3)) by ONE in-plane redstone block at (-2,3) (TP's back, L2's top, L1's QC cell neighbor): open = clear it (they retract, pulling ML, TL, TM), close = set it (they push them back).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/s79/c78l/L3d.txt
let lo = 13
let lc = 10
open 0 use 5 -1 0
open lo clear -2 3 0
close 0 use 5 -1 0
close lc set -2 3 0 minecraft:redstone_block
